NOTE ON DATA: this licence covers the SOFTWARE only. It grants no rights to the
data the software fetches at runtime, which is governed by each upstream
provider's own terms. In particular:

  * airplanes.live and adsb.fi are NON-COMMERCIAL use only.
  * adsb.lol data is ODbL 1.0 (share-alike).
  * planespotters.net photo metadata is subject to their Photo API Terms of Use,
    which forbid re-exposing their API and require displayed attribution. Image
    binaries are never downloaded, stored or re-hosted by this software.
  * Esri, GEBCO and NOAA/NWS (via Iowa State Mesonet) require attribution.
  * OurAirports and Natural Earth are public domain.

See docs/data-sources.md for the full terms review, and note that this project
is single-user and unauthenticated by design — which is part of what keeps it
inside those non-commercial terms.
